# Cardputer CP/M WiFi configuration
#
# Copy this file to the ROOT of the SD card and rename it:
#
#   WIFI.CFG
#
# Networks are tried in numeric order.
# PASSn may be left empty for an open network.
#
# Addressing defaults to DHCP. To give one network a static address,
# add IPn, MASKn and GWn for the same network number. DNSn is optional;
# if omitted, the gateway address is used as DNS.
#
# Example static settings for network 1:
#
# IP1=192.168.1.50
# MASK1=255.255.255.0
# GW1=192.168.1.1
# DNS1=192.168.1.1
#
# Passwords are stored as plain text on the SD card.

SSID1=Home Network
PASS1=replace-with-password

SSID2=Phone Hotspot
PASS2=replace-with-password

SSID3=Workshop
PASS3=replace-with-password
